{"articleNo":"65996","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=65996&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학교육역량]2012학년도 동계 해외단기어학연수 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.20","hit":"5130","attachments":[{"name":"2012학년도 동계 해외단기어학연수 시행 계획(홈피공지용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=65996&attachNo=72043"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012년 교육역량강화사업 동계 해외단기어학연수를 다음과 같이 시행하오니 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 접수기간 : 2012.09.20.(목) ~ 09.25.(화)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 연수시행국가 및 기간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"HStyle0\"><!--StartFragment--></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"29\" valign=\"center\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">연수국가</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDI